vices,service orchestration,workflow states,state reference,Step functions,Step functions workflows,Map state,Map state processing mode,Map state processing modes,Inline map state,Distributed map state,Inline vs distributed map state" /><link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" href="state-map.md" title="Markdown version" /><script type="application/ld+json">
